<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>我的博客</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #0f0f0f;
            color: #eeeeee;
            font-family: Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        }

        .top {
            height: 70px;
            background: #29283f;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 22px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .top-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* 设置按钮 */
        .settings-btn {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .settings-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            transform: rotate(25deg);
        }

        /* 设置弹窗背景 */
        .settings-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
            z-index: 999;
        }

        .settings-overlay.show {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 82px 18px 20px;
        }

        /* 设置窗口 */
        .settings-box {
            width: 310px;
            max-width: 92vw;
            background: #202020;
            border: 1px solid #383838;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            animation: settingsIn 0.18s ease;
        }

        @keyframes settingsIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-8px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .settings-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .settings-header h2 {
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .close-btn {
            border: 0;
            background: transparent;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .close-btn:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }

        .language-title {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .language-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .language-item {
            width: 100%;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 11px 12px;
            background: transparent;
            color: #eee;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .language-item:hover {
            background: #303030;
        }

        .language-item.active {
            background: #34344d;
        }

        .check {
            color: #66aaff;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 50px 25px 80px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 10px 50px;
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            margin: auto;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #303030;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 38px;
            border: 1px solid #444;
        }

        .intro h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .intro p {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .line {
            height: 1px;
            background: #292929;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .article {
            padding: 30px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
        }

        .date {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .article h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .article p {
            color: #bdbdbd;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .read {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #4d91e8;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .read:hover {
            color: #75adff;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .about {
            padding: 45px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
        }

        .about h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about p {
            color: #bbb;
            line-height: 2;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .tags {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #1d1d1d;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            margin-right: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .contact {
            padding-top: 45px;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact p {
            color: #aaa;
            line-height: 2;
        }

        .contact a {
            color: #5599ee;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding-left: 22px;
                padding-right: 22px;
            }

            .intro h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }

            .intro p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .article h2 {
                font-size: 27px;
            }

            .article p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .settings-overlay.show {
                padding-top: 78px;
            }

            .settings-box {
                width: 300px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="top">
    <div class="top-title" data-i18n="blogTitle">我的博客</div>

    <!-- 左上角设置 -->
    <button class="settings-btn" onclick="openSettings()" aria-label="Settings">
        ⚙
    </button>
</header>

<!-- 设置窗口 -->
<div class="settings-overlay" id="settingsOverlay" onclick="overlayClick(event)">
    <div class="settings-box">
        <div class="settings-header">
            <h2 data-i18n="settings">设置</h2>
            <button class="close-btn" onclick="closeSettings()">×</button>
        </div>

        <div class="language-title" data-i18n="language">语言</div>

        <div class="language-list">
            <button class="language-item" data-lang="zh-CN" onclick="changeLanguage('zh-CN')">
                <span>🇨🇳 简体中文</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="zh-TW" onclick="changeLanguage('zh-TW')">
                <span>🇹🇼 繁體中文</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="en" onclick="changeLanguage('en')">
                <span>🇺🇸 English</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="ru" onclick="changeLanguage('ru')">
                <span>🇷🇺 Русский</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="fr" onclick="changeLanguage('fr')">
                <span>🇫🇷 Français</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="ko" onclick="changeLanguage('ko')">
                <span>🇰🇷 한국어</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="ja" onclick="changeLanguage('ja')">
                <span>🇯🇵 日本語</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>

            <button class="language-item" data-lang="ar-EG" onclick="changeLanguage('ar-EG')">
                <span>🇪🇬 العربية</span><span class="check"></span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<main class="container">

    <section class="intro">
        <div class="avatar">叙焚</div>

        <h1 data-i18n="personalHome">个人主页</h1>

        <p data-i18n="team">思怡团队</p>
    </section>

    <div class="line"></div>

    <article class="article">
        <div class="date">2026年10月5日</div>

        <h2 data-i18n="aboutMeTitle">关于我</h2>

        <p data-i18n="aboutMeText">
            你好，我是叙焚<br>
            主玩《蔚蓝档案》《碧蓝档案》《Blue Archive》<br>
            SCP基金会、AI（Si）、游戏、二次元、软件、编程
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="read" data-i18n="readMore">阅读更多 →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="article">
        <div class="date">2026年10月1日</div>

        <h2 data-i18n="agreementTitle">遵守协议</h2>

        <p data-i18n="agreementText">
            我作为思怡团队 主代表人 我们会严格遵守各种协议<br>
            思怡团队 以及我（XuFen）都会 严格遵守协议 版权<br>
            如果我们有侵权 或者其他人对我们侵权 请联系我们
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="read" data-i18n="readMore">阅读更多 →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="article">
        <div class="date">2026年9月25日</div>

        <h2 data-i18n="teamTitle">思怡团队</h2>

        <p data-i18n="teamText">
            思怡团队是由叙焚成立的一个团队<br>
            思怡团队是一个小团队<br>
            里面会开发一些应用
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="read" data-i18n="readMore">阅读更多 →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="article">
        <div class="date">2026年9月20日</div>

        <h2 data-i18n="lastMessageTitle">最后留言</h2>

        <p data-i18n="lastMessageText">
            𝕏（X平台）唯一账号 @XuFenSiYi<br>
            其他账号如果没有在X平台公开那就是假的<br>
            我们会在X平台发布我们的账号信息<br>
            我的唯一QQ:3247459590<br>
            QQ思怡团队交流群:115891656<br>
            QQ频道:pd68241571
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="read" data-i18n="readMore">阅读更多 →</a>
    </article>

    <section class="about">
        <h2 data-i18n="myTags">我的标签</h2>

        <p></p>

        <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag" data-i18n="tagBA">蔚蓝档案</span>
            <span class="tag" data-i18n="tagSCP">SCP基金会</span>
            <span class="tag" data-i18n="tagTeam">思怡团队</span>
            <span class="tag" data-i18n="tagGames">游戏/编程/软件</span>
            <span class="tag" data-i18n="tagAnime">二次元</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact">
        <h2 data-i18n="contact">联系我们</h2>

        <p>
            <span data-i18n="qq">QQ：</span>
            <a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/U4FtOyaKMm" target="_blank">3247459590</a>
        </p>

        <p>
            <span data-i18n="email">邮箱：</span>
            <a href="mailto:3247459590@qq.com">3247459590@qq.com</a>
        </p>

        <p>
            <span data-i18n="group">QQ思怡团队交流群：</span>
            <a href="https://pd.qq.com/s/ain4t0431?b=9" target="_blank">115891656</a>
        </p>

        <p>
            <span data-i18n="channel">QQ思怡频道：</span>
            <a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/U4FtOyaKMm" target="_blank">pd68241571</a>
        </p>

        <p>
            𝕏（X）：
            <a href="https://x.com/XuFen_SiYi_Mika" target="_blank">@XuFen_SiYi_Mika</a>
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
        © 2026
    </footer>

</main>

